  "query_preview": "..\n(Wednesday Night through next Tuesday)\nIssued at 1120 AM CDT Tue Sep 22 2026\n\nThe synoptic pattern for the rest of the forecast period looks to be \nbenign for Middle Tennessee. After this short bout of rainfall, we \nwill once again enter an overall dry pattern for the weekend. Highs \nwill be in the mid to upper 80s through the weekend, with lows \nsinking into the 50s (and even the upper 40s on the Cumberland \nPlateau!). It may seem like autumn has finally arrived, but \ntemperatures will warm once again into next work week back into the \nupper 80s and low 90s. With no severe weather anticipated in the \ncurrent pattern, the focus in the next few days will shift to the \ndry pattern continuing to evolve in Middle Tennessee.",
